# oracle: S3-CONTROL S1, S2: a Reset writes the parameter alters right after it as alterparam, then reset, which applies them (inp.c:1735-1857, runcoms2.c:172-240); written by hand
file "script_reset.sp" deck
  title "script_reset"
  param p = 1k
  alter (element_value r1) value=2k
  analysis op
  reset values options temp tnom saves
  alter (param p) value=3k
  analysis op
